	(text_box "SPEAKER DRIVER  Q1, Q2\nEach chip is one P + one N switch. Together they flip the speaker's voltage back and forth 200,000 times a second; the speaker only follows the slow sound part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 20.32 0)
		(size 63.5 21.59)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
