		(uuid "33d381a3-1617-5106-84b8-eed58b214c43")
	)
	(text_box "EAR-PAD WIRES  J1, J2, J7, J8\nFour thin wires run up the glasses arm: two to the bone-conduction speaker (J1/J2), two to the status light (J7/J8, current set by R14)."
